# Pokemon Crystal: boot from the battery save (title, CONTINUE, the player
# box) and take a first step -- the clock check after a link session.  If the
# cartridge clock was not re-based to this PSP's clock, Crystal stops at "The
# clock's time may be wrong" and asks for the time instead of reaching the
# overworld: the step never happens and the script fails there.
repeat 5
wait 120
press START
endrepeat
wait 200
hold A 8
wait 60
hold A 8
wait 180
evt booted
logbytes where 4 0xDCB5
# the overworld runs: wait for the map number to settle, then one step down
waitramne 1 0xDCB5 0xFF 0 600
hold DOWN 20
wait 60
logbytes moved 4 0xDCB5
# the step landed: y 3 -> 4 (PC 2F, where the trade's save put us)
waitram 1 0xDCB7 0xFF 4 60
evt clock_ok
